Use llvm/Plugins/PassPlugin.h in this installed LLVM version. Return the
header-provided LLVM_PLUGIN_API_VERSION; no custom plugin-version macro is
needed. The plugin's own version string is distinct from that API version.

The installed function-pipeline parsing callback takes:

  llvm::StringRef Name
  llvm::FunctionPassManager &FPM
  llvm::ArrayRef<llvm::PassBuilder::PipelineElement> InnerPipeline

It recognizes a name, adds the corresponding pass to FPM, and returns true.
It returns false for a name it does not handle. Our simple passes also reject
